                  "about":  "Je suis Venance Arnolde Yeminvenon Houndete, etudiant en Licence 3 Securite Informatique a l\u0027IFRI, Universite d\u0027Abomey-Calavi au Benin, aspirant RSSI.\n\nJ\u0027ai une experience pratique en audit GRC et en tests d\u0027intrusion web black-box reels. J\u0027ai conduit des audits pour l\u0027Universite d\u0027Abomey-Calavi, notamment autour de la PSSI-UAC v2.0 pour un SI de 60 000 utilisateurs, et pour GRAFNET Consulting, ou j\u0027ai identifie des vulnerabilites critiques sur des plateformes e-commerce en production.\n\nJe suis disponible pour des missions professionnelles en cybersecurite offensive et defensive, gestion des risques, gouvernance SI et conformite.",
                  "aboutEn":  "I am Venance Arnolde Yeminvenon Houndete, a third-year Cybersecurity student at IFRI, University of Abomey-Calavi in Benin, and an aspiring CISO.\n\nI have practical experience in GRC audits and real black-box web penetration testing. I worked on audits for the University of Abomey-Calavi and GRAFNET Consulting, where I identified critical vulnerabilities on production e-commerce platforms.\n\nI am available for professional missions in offensive and defensive cybersecurity, risk management, IS governance and compliance.",
